sequenceDiagram
    title UC06 酒店订单支付取消退款——对象级顺序图
    participant P0 as 用户
    participant P1 as MyOrders.vue
    participant P2 as HotelController
    participant P3 as HotelOrderServiceImpl
    participant P4 as HotelOrderMapper
    participant P5 as HotelRoomStockServiceImpl
    P0->>P1: 选择订单操作
    P1->>P2: POST /api/hotel/order/{orderNo}/动作
    P2->>P3: pay/cancel/requestRefund
    P3->>P4: 按用户和当前状态条件更新
    P4-->>P3: 返回更新结果
    P3->>P5: 取消/退款时回补库存
    P5-->>P3: 回补成功或幂等跳过
    P3-->>P2: 返回终态
    Note over P0,P5: 重复请求不得重复回补；超时关闭由 OrderTimeoutScheduler 复用同一状态与库存规则。
